## Iteration 2 Completion Summary

### Problem Fixed
The `file_mtime()` function in `lib/compat.sh` was returning verbose stat output on Linux systems instead of just the epoch timestamp. This caused stale heartbeat detection to fail in the cleanup script with arithmetic expression errors.

### Solution Applied
Added output filtering to extract only numeric epoch timestamp values from the `file_mtime()` function. This ensures compatibility across both macOS (stat -f format) and Linux (stat -c format) systems.

